Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but that's\Nwhat it said it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.61,0:01:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's rain after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, we're on mop duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so happy about anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my sister Serenity is finally\Ngetting her eye operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to the three million\Nbucks that Yugi won at Dula's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna get her sight back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So when do we visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom's gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And ever since Serenity and\NI was separated as kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,my mom and I haven't\Nseen eye to eye. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll go without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My only concern is whether\Nor not Serenity likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get any funny ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me which hospital she's at and\NI'll go visit sweet Serenity alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:02:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be a third wheel? Yeah,\NTristan. I'll take it to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, hey, how's it going?\NYugi, not so great actually. I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,need your help and so does\Nthe spirit of the Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Puzzle, oh, uh-huh, you see,\NTaya, whoever it was that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,stole the puzzle seemed to\Nknow a lot about its past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminded the spirit how\Nlittle he knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.87,0:02:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out with you might\Nhelp him figure things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but how exactly\Nam I going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You always have great\Nadvice. Just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.27,0:02:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten o'clock tomorrow at Domino\NStation. Thanks, Taya. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope I really can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling today\Nis going to be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if I can figure out what\Nto wear, we can get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.61,0:03:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Yugi, what's this big surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if I told you, then it\Nwouldn't be a surprise, now would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still have many riddles to unlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for\Nsurprises. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What I've got planned is going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I going to help the\Nspirit figure out his past?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know a little bit\Nabout the Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not sure there's\Nanything I can tell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.41,0:03:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,him about it that he doesn't already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way too much pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, spirit, this\Nis where you take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, I'm not, you\Ncan't, this isn't a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.83,0:03:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to have a lot on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's something we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ancient Egypt exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now that could be interesting, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And check out this old stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.09,0:04:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It has the same symbol\Nas the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, but this exhibit's gotta\Nhelp answer some questions about your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we could do something else instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.47,0:04:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to see the\Nexhibit, it's totally up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You must forgive me, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately I feel like a stranger to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many details\Nabout who I am and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,where I came from that I\Ncan't seem to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe we should start with\Nthe things that you do remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my origins lie in ancient Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and I now reside within the Millennium\NPuzzle, but that's about all. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When Yugi first put the puzzle\Ntogether and our bond began,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,it was as if my spirit was reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Since that day, I've felt\Nthat I'm here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That destiny brought me to Yugi to\Naccomplish something of great importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,After the puzzle was almost taken away from\Nus, that feeling began to grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the key to understanding\Nwhy I'm here lies in my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it makes you feel any better,\NI'm going through the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My situation's not\Nexactly the same as yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not sure why I'm here or\Nwhat my future holds either. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.35,0:05:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So for now, I'm just going to listen to\Nmy heart and see where that takes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And my heart is telling me to\Nbecome a dancer. That's great,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, I always tell Yugi to\Nfollow his heart, and who knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I may find out that dancing isn't for me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll never know\Nunless I try I guess what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:06:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to say is Don't look at the\Nunknown as your enemy See it as an adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally just inspired myself Let's go see\Nwhat the world has in store for us today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are we going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever we're inspired to go\NLife's an adventure, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.37,0:06:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Players can trade their\Ndual monster cards here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Today must be your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go in and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,These cards are both very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to be cheering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Light Force Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an excellent trick\Ncard and a wise trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Excited, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The next stop for us is the arcade!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place is so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your groove on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Steps, go, Steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Steps! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fancy football.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Johnny gets his moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know where he got that hairdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants the honor of being\NJohnny Steps' next victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of dueling dance game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds like a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You, girl in the pink,\Nyou feeling lucky today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we ignore him\Nand go someplace else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy may have some flashy moves, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.05,0:07:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're not flashy\Nenough to scare me away. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Having some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We go when I say we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you're the man, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:08:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her know who's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you back out now and\Nsave yourself some embarrassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's gonna be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.19,0:08:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.37,0:08:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna wish you\Nnever stepped on my stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for me to step all over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a life, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.47,0:08:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to make some noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time this creep learned\Nwhat real dancing's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you two are off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a photo finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Check her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's busted moves\Neven Johnny can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's saving his best moves for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:09:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to break out my signature moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This jerk's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, keep it clean, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still beating him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Steps is going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's about to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny's bugging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's just awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the look on Johnny's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully getting beaten at\Nhis own game will shut him up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:10:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,For a while. You were great\Ntoday, you know? Taya, I've been
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking about what you said\Nearlier could you remind me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly what it was I said\Nearlier you said you were unsure
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,about your life too and that\Nwhen in doubt you follow your
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,heart and my heart is now\Ntelling me that I must uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the secrets of my origin no\Nmatter where the search may
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,lead me he's really determined\Nto find out about his past,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've got a bad\Nfeeling it's going to lead
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,him and Yugi to more danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad my advice could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And just so you know, while you're\Nout there searching for some answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,your friends will be\Nright there by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,searching along with you. Thank you. Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.11,0:10:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you two geeks mind if I step in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've humbly come down here to\Nask you for a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have easily won if\Nmy leg hadn't cramped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that you owe me a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a rematch,\Nbut we'll duel my way. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, porcupine head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is just\Nbetween me and the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, may I finish off your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,opponent? Uh, sure. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of either of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Name your game, you little freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The game is duel monsters, and if you\Nlose, you're never to bother Taya again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if I win, the girl will have to\Ngo out on a date with Johnny Steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenging Johnny Steps to\Na duel was a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You two losers have no idea\Nwho you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.55,0:11:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen up, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny doesn't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you may think you\Nbeat me today, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was only because\Nof a freak accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya defeated you fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe what you want\Nto believe, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's about time\Nyou learned your lesson steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I start off this show?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonic made an attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This maine's gonna clean your clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Celtic Guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Sonic Maid with your steel sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.91,0:12:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you just got lucky, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't let it\Ngo to your spiky head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel just started!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make an even bigger splash when\NI play Water Emotics in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That card?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.49,0:12:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what is Johnny up to?\NWhat? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:12:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Every duelist knows a strong deck\Nneeds cards that support each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But Johnny's monsters seem to\Nbe all over the place. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can win by\Nthrowing random monsters against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you're sadly mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm quaking in my boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe your puny brain\Ncan't figure out my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've even got a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who wins in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose to end my turn\Nwithout playing a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of the Harp in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,along with a magic card,\NChorus of Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My little cherub friend\Nincreases the defense
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,power of my Spirit of\Nthe Harp by 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Johnny's a far better duelist\Nthan I've given him credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:14:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With Spirit of the Harp in defense mode,\Nit's harder to take down his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's still made one mistake and it's\Ngonna cost ready Johnny steps because
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for you to face the music I\Nsummon curse of dragon in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,incinerate water emotics with your dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.49,0:14:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,flame oh I just messed up I forgot to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,switch her into defense mode Johnny doesn't\NI don't even know who he's up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, you're hitting\Nall the wrong notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just tuning up for the grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, a surprise guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch of the Black Forest in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Johnny planning to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's more to come, Duel fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my polymerization card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,using Witch of the Black Forest and\NLady of Faith together to create
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,a whole new rock-and-rollin' entity\Nbetter known as the Musician King.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How about playing a little\Nlullaby for Celtic Guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess your Celtic Guardian wasn't\Na big fan of the electric guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise the music will be much\Nmore romantic on our date, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just lay this card face down\Non the field, ending my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire your flame and\Nsilence the Musician King!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally played you! A trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to crank up the\Nvolume with Metal Morph!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,which transforms Musician King into\Nthe punk rockin' Heavy Metal King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,His attack and defense points\Nclimb up to the top of the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Play the dragon a couple of riffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, how pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're nothing\Nbut a one-hit wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.45,0:16:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Johnny actually win?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant Soldier of Stone in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't really expect that\Nboulder to stop my Heavy Metal King,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,especially not with Metal Morph.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.15,0:16:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It increases his power with every attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.51,0:16:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this next song is going\Nto be just a tremendous smash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And kick it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.27,0:16:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirit's in major trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just give up already, loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.87,0:17:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your monsters can\Njam with my heavy metal king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.91,0:17:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I call forth Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Heavy Metal King!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.19,0:17:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The fun just never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With Metal Morse Effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy Metal King's attack strength\Nis greater than Dark Magician's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny, your ability to\Nmiscalculate is uncanny. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your overconfidence renders you blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,your heavy metal king has been shattered\Nimpossible because metal morph raises heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,metal king's attack power you're almost\Ncorrect johnny but you left out one rule
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.95,0:17:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true metal morph increases your attack\Npower but only when your monster attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but since my monster attacked heavy metal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,king didn't receive\Nthe power bonus leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.55,0:18:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,His attack strength less than that of the\NDark Magician. Metal Morph is a powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,card when used correctly but maybe you\Nshould have read the instruction manual first
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,i've put an end to your musical mayhem but
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.01,0:18:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,that just isn't fair you must have cheated
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me your name just call me yugi wait
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just a second that name sort of rings a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the same Yugi who defeated\NPegasus in Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that my name struck a chord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.73,0:18:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to finish this duel,\Nand it's your move, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.13,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hang with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.53,0:18:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dancer, not a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi takes a slight lead in\Nthe duel, and you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just like when you\Ntried to cheat and tripped
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,me when I started winning\Nduring the dance battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When things turn a little bit hairy,\Nyou get scared and start running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And so what if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forfeiting is much better\Nthan facing defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.53,0:19:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody loves a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let people see me as a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how many friends\Ndo you have, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got tons and tons\Nof friends. None, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,One, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.39,0:19:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,One, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure about that because that's one friend\Nmore than I would have guessed you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just watch your mouth I don't\Nhave to stay here and take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.49,0:19:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand people who\Ndon't face their problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody fails sometimes\NBut the important
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,thing is having the\Ncourage to look trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.77,0:19:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,straight in the eye If you really want to\Nbe a winner be someone who never gives up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a point. Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, thanks for being honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:19:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully now he'll face his problems\Ninstead of running away You're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's exactly what I have to do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Domino Museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you were right\Nabout this Egyptian exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it may hold clues to the\Nmysteries of my ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Answers to some of my questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me here\Nand for helping me today, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are friends for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's beyond those\Ndoors, I'm ready to face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.47,0:20:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We are ready to face it. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm right with you.
